# .clang-tidy de C (schematize-c). Lista de checks NO repo, travando o CI.
Checks: >-
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  misc-*,
  performance-*,
  readability-braces-around-statements,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -cert-dcl37-c,
  -cert-dcl51-cpp
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*'
